#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section outlines reference architectures and guidance tailored for "
"specialized Mattermost deployment scenarios, enabling organizations to "
"build secure, compliant, and resilient collaboration environments across "
"diverse operational contexts."
msgstr ""
"이 섹션은 특수 OKR.BEST 배포 시나리오에 맞춘 참조 아키텍처와 안내를 설명하여, "
"조직이 다양한 운영 맥락 전반에서 안전하고 규정을 준수하며 회복탄력적인 협업 "
"환경을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Whether you’re implementing out-of-band communications, mission partner "
"collaboration, sovereign collaboration within Microsoft ecosystems, or "
"mission-critical operations at the edge, these architectures offer "
"comprehensive guidance, design patterns, and best practices to ensure "
"robust and reliable deployments."
msgstr ""
"대역 외 커뮤니케이션, 임무 파트너 협업, Microsoft 생태계 내 주권적 협업, "
"또는 엣지에서의 미션 크리티컬 운영 중 무엇을 구현하든, 이 아키텍처는 견고하고 "
"신뢰할 수 있는 배포를 보장하기 위한 종합적인 안내, 설계 패턴, 모범 사례를 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:19
msgid ""
":doc:`Out-of-Band Communications </deployment-guide/reference-"
"architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-oob>` - Deploy Mattermost as an "
"isolated, pre-provisioned communication system for incident response and "
"business continuity."
msgstr ""
":doc:`대역 외 커뮤니케이션 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/deploy-oob>` - 사고 대응과 비즈니스 연속성을 위해 "
"OKR.BEST를 격리된 사전 프로비저닝 커뮤니케이션 시스템으로 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`Mission Partner Collaboration </deployment-guide/reference-"
"architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner>` - Multi-"
"organizational collaboration architecture with secure information sharing"
" between allied networks and coalition partners."
msgstr ""
":doc:`임무 파트너 협업 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-"
"scenarios/deploy-mission-partner>` - 동맹 네트워크와 연합 파트너 간 안전한 "
"정보 공유를 지원하는 다조직 협업 아키텍처입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:21
msgid ""
":doc:`Enterprise to Edge DDIL Operations </deployment-guide/reference-"
"architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations>` - Deployment "
"patterns for Denied, Degraded, Intermittent, and Limited (DDIL) "
"communication environments with offline capabilities."
msgstr ""
":doc:`엔터프라이즈-엣지 DDIL 운영 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/deploy-ddil-operations>` - 오프라인 기능을 갖춘 거부·"
"열화·간헐·제한(DDIL) 커뮤니케이션 환경을 위한 배포 패턴입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:22
msgid ""
":doc:`Sovereign Collaboration in Microsoft </deployment-guide/reference-"
"architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration>` - "
"Integration architecture for sovereign cloud environments with Microsoft "
"Teams, Outlook and other M365 services."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Microsoft 환경의 주권적 협업 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration>` - Microsoft Teams, "
"Outlook 및 기타 M365 서비스를 사용하는 주권적 클라우드 환경을 위한 통합 "
"아키텍처입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deployment-scenarios-index.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Air-gapped Deployment </deployment-guide/reference-architecture"
"/deployment-scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>` - Guidance and best "
"practices when deploying Mattermost in air-gapped environments."
msgstr ""
":doc:`에어갭 배포 </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-"
"scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>` - 에어갭 환경에 OKR.BEST를 배포할 때의 "
"안내와 모범 사례입니다."

